        (
            name: "get-event-selectors",
            aliases: [],
            description: Some("Describes the settings for the event selectors that you configured for your trail. The information returned for your event selectors includes the following:   If your event selector includes read-only events, write-only events, or all events. This applies to management events, data events, and network activity events.   If your event selector includes management events.   If your event selector includes network activity events, the event sources for which you are logging network activity events.   If your event selector includes data events, the resources on which you are logging data events.   For more information about logging management, data, and network activity events, see the following topics in the CloudTrail User Guide:    Logging management events     Logging data events     Logging network activity events"),
