                    description: Some("A JSON string that contains the Insights types you want to log on a trail or event data store. ApiCallRateInsight and ApiErrorRateInsight are valid Insight types. The ApiCallRateInsight Insights type analyzes write-only management API calls that are aggregated per minute against a baseline API call volume. The ApiErrorRateInsight Insights type analyzes management API calls that result in error codes. The error is shown if the API call is unsuccessful"),
